      \field{abstract}{In this paper, we deﬁne a workﬂow and a toolchain to support fast mobility scenario prototyping based on open data and open-source software. SAGA is an activity-based multi-modal mobility scenario generator for the Simulation of Urban MObiltiy (SUMO). Starting from an OpenStreetMap (OSM) ﬁle, SAGA extracts the data required to build a multi-modal scenario, and in a step-by-step fashion, generates the conﬁgurations needed to execute it, including the intermediate steps required to reﬁne the scenario with additional data, allowing the iterative improvement of realism and representativeness.}
